360		/**
361		 * (BUS-RESYNC) Durable agent status for every live terminal binding on this
362		 * host. The WS event bus is fire-and-forget — an event broadcast while a
363		 * renderer is disconnected is DESTROYED, and a blocked agent emits no
364		 * further hook events, so a dot lost that way can never self-heal. The
